==Description==
The '''Tilted Nametag''' is an unreleased nametag which was originally supposed to release back in 2020.

The '''Tilted Nametag''' has a similar appearance to the [[Default Nametag]] with white text and a black outline. Each character in the nametag swings from right to left.

